{"unit_id":"pdong15dth__dsh-computer-use-windows#card-zh","repo":"pdong15dth/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8e50ceeb4a9111c8e6199dca8c8849555d1ace45","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 是面向 DSH 的 Windows 桌面控制插件：它注册工具并通过本机 Win32 helper 操作桌面。可查询显示器信息、截取桌面或指定区域、操作鼠标键盘、管理窗口和剪贴板，并启动应用或打开文件网址。适合需要让 DSH agent 观察和交互 Windows 桌面的用户。首次调用可用系统 csc.exe 编译 helper，也支持 PowerShell 回退；不需要 API 密钥或在线服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:475","index.js:1314"]}
{"unit_id":"pdong15dth__dsh-computer-use-windows#card-en","repo":"pdong15dth/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8e50ceeb4a9111c8e6199dca8c8849555d1ace45","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows adds Windows desktop tools to DSH through a local Win32 helper. Agents can inspect and capture screens, use the mouse and keyboard, manage windows and clipboard text, and launch apps or open files. The helper is compiled on first use, with a PowerShell fallback.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:475","index.js:1314"]}
