{"unit_id":"pdong15dth__dsh-computer-use-windows#feature-1","repo":"pdong15dth/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8e50ceeb4a9111c8e6199dca8c8849555d1ace45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 的功能「屏幕查看」：可查询虚拟桌面、显示器和光标信息，并截取全桌面、单个显示器或指定区域；截图返回图像及坐标映射。 通过 DSH 工具调用触发并返回操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:479","index.js:521"]}
{"unit_id":"pdong15dth__dsh-computer-use-windows#feature-2","repo":"pdong15dth/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8e50ceeb4a9111c8e6199dca8c8849555d1ace45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 的功能「鼠标与键盘」：可移动、点击、双击、拖动和滚动鼠标，也能向当前焦点输入 Unicode 文本、按快捷键或依序发送按键。 通过 DSH 工具调用触发并返回操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:652","index.js:835"]}
{"unit_id":"pdong15dth__dsh-computer-use-windows#feature-3","repo":"pdong15dth/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8e50ceeb4a9111c8e6199dca8c8849555d1ace45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 的功能「窗口管理」：可按标题筛选顶层窗口并读取其位置和状态，再通过句柄或标题执行聚焦、最小化、最大化、恢复或关闭。 通过 DSH 工具调用触发并返回操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:979","index.js:1022"]}
{"unit_id":"pdong15dth__dsh-computer-use-windows#feature-4","repo":"pdong15dth/dsh-computer-use-windows","commit":"8e50ceeb4a9111c8e6199dca8c8849555d1ace45","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use-windows 的功能「剪贴板与启动」：可读取、写入或清空 Windows 文本剪贴板，也可通过 Windows shell 启动应用、打开文件路径或网址。 通过 DSH 工具调用触发并返回操作结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:930","index.js:1072"]}
